{"analytics_identifier":null,"base_path":"/government/publications/dfe-major-projects-appointment-letters-for-senior-responsible-owners","content_id":"ff39c42f-5ec5-44af-8ae0-c1daa8c3a19d","description":"DfE appointment letters for Government Major Projects Portfolio (GMPP) Senior Responsible Owners (SROs).","details":{"attachments":[{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6a1eb5efb95db968c8f3bd45","filename":"2026-05-12_-_Final-GMPP-SRO-Appointment-Letter_-_Daniel_Foster.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":1146356,"filename":"2026-05-12_-_Final-GMPP-SRO-Appointment-Letter_-_Daniel_Foster.pdf","id":"9319709","isbn":"","number_of_pages":6,"title":"Families First Partnership Programme: SRO appointment letter","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6a1eb5efb95db968c8f3bd45/2026-05-12_-_Final-GMPP-SRO-Appointment-Letter_-_Daniel_Foster.pdf"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"68dbfd01ef1c2f72bc1e4c6d","filename":"LLE_SRO_Letter_for_Patrick_Curry.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":264837,"filename":"LLE_SRO_Letter_for_Patrick_Curry.pdf","id":"9319701","isbn":"","number_of_pages":7,"title":"Lifelong Learning Entitlement Programme: SRO appointment letter","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/68dbfd01ef1c2f72bc1e4c6d/LLE_SRO_Letter_for_Patrick_Curry.pdf"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"67a21775567402152f553bf1","filename":"FE_capital_transformation_programme_SRO_appointment_letter_Dec_24.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":245497,"filename":"FE_capital_transformation_programme_SRO_appointment_letter_Dec_24.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9319702","isbn":"","number_of_pages":6,"title":"FE capital transformation programme: SRO appointment letter","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/67a21775567402152f553bf1/FE_capital_transformation_programme_SRO_appointment_letter_Dec_24.pdf"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"6789380f69b9b76c761d0528","filename":"TLevels_SROLetter_Chatwin-Belfourd_2024.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":406422,"filename":"TLevels_SROLetter_Chatwin-Belfourd_2024.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9319703","isbn":"","number_of_pages":6,"title":"T Levels: SRO appointment letter ","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/6789380f69b9b76c761d0528/TLevels_SROLetter_Chatwin-Belfourd_2024.pdf"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"65d7647554f1e7001a16589f","filename":"2023_05_IPA_GMPP_SRO_letter_of_appointment_for_SRP_PD_SRO.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":264795,"filename":"2023_05_IPA_GMPP_SRO_letter_of_appointment_for_SRP_PD_SRO.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9319704","isbn":"","number_of_pages":4,"title":"School rebuilding programme: SRO appointment letter","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/65d7647554f1e7001a16589f/2023_05_IPA_GMPP_SRO_letter_of_appointment_for_SRP_PD_SRO.pdf"},{"accessible":true,"alternative_format_contact_email":"alternative.formats@education.gov.uk","assets":[{"asset_manager_id":"5fa28c94e90e070428701574","filename":"Student_Loans_Company_Evolve_programme_SRO_appointment_letter.pdf"}],"attachment_type":"file","command_paper_number":"","content_type":"application/pdf","file_size":472823,"filename":"Student_Loans_Company_Evolve_programme_SRO_appointment_letter.pdf","hoc_paper_number":"","id":"9319705","isbn":"","number_of_pages":9,"title":"Student Loans Company, evolve programme: SRO appointment letter","unique_reference":"","unnumbered_command_paper":false,"unnumbered_hoc_paper":false,"url":"https://assets.publishing.service.gov.uk/media/5fa28c94e90e070428701574/Student_Loans_Company_Evolve_programme_SRO_appointment_letter.pdf"}],"body":"<div class=\"govspeak\"><p>Each government department publishes the letters of appointment for their <abbr title=\"Government Major Projects Portfolio\">GMPP</abbr> Senior Responsible Owners (<abbr title=\"Senior Responsible Owners\">SROs</abbr>). These letters include the date of appointment, the project deliverables, what the <abbr title=\"Senior Responsible Owner\">SRO</abbr> is responsible for and how long the role is expected to last.</p>\n\n<p>The <a href=\"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/departmental-evidence-and-response-to-select-committees-guidance\">guidance for officials giving evidence to Parliamentary Select Committees, known as the Osmotherly Rules</a>, was updated on 17 October 2014. As part of this update, we are committed to publishing <abbr title=\"Government Major Projects Portfolio\">GMPP</abbr> <abbr title=\"Senior Responsible Owner\">SRO</abbr> letters of appointment.</p>\n\n</div>","change_history":[{"note":"Added 'Families First Partnership Programme: SRO appointment letter'.","public_timestamp":"2026-06-02T12:33:50Z"},{"note":"Removed the following: 'Lifelong loan entitlement programme: SRO appointment letter', 'Early Years and Childcare Reform Programme: SRO appointment letter', 'National Tutoring Programme: SRO appointment letter', 'Higher technical education programme: SRO appointment letter', 'Initial teacher training reform project: SRO appointment letter', 'Teacher development reform programme: SRO appointment letter', 'Early career framework and national professional qualification programmes: SRO appointment letter', 'Social Work England: SRO appointment letter', 'Priority school building programme 2: SRO appointment letter', 'Apprenticeship reform programme: SRO appointment letter' and 'Schools commercial: SRO appointment letter'.","public_timestamp":"2026-05-27T11:22:37Z"},{"note":"Added 'Lifelong Learning Entitlement Programme: SRO appointment letter'.\r\n","public_timestamp":"2025-10-01T13:56:56Z"},{"note":"Added 'Early Years and Childcare Reform Programme: SRO appointment letter'.","public_timestamp":"2025-04-22T11:40:04Z"},{"note":"Updated 'FE capital transformation programme: SRO appointment letter'. The Senior Responsible Owner has changed.","public_timestamp":"2025-02-06T14:21:47Z"},{"note":"Updated 'T Levels: SRO appointment letter' with the letter appointing Rebekah Chatwin and Jane Belfourd as joint interim SROs for T Levels.","public_timestamp":"2025-01-20T15:32:24Z"},{"note":"Added 'National Tutoring Programme: SRO appointment letter'.","public_timestamp":"2024-08-01T09:50:46Z"},{"note":"Updated 'Initial teacher training reform (ITT reform) project: SRO appointment letter' due to a change in Senior Responsible Owner.","public_timestamp":"2024-03-08T16:04:39Z"},{"note":"Updated 'Higher technical education programme: SRO appointment letter' due to a change in Senior Responsible Owner.","public_timestamp":"2024-03-07T14:26:05Z"},{"note":"Updated 'School rebuilding programme: SRO appointment letter' due to a change in Senior Responsible Owner.","public_timestamp":"2024-02-23T14:15:43Z"},{"note":"Replaced 'T Levels: SRO re-appointment letter' with 'T Levels: SRO appointment letter'.\r\n\r\n","public_timestamp":"2024-02-15T11:34:35Z"},{"note":"'FE Capital Transformation programme: SRO appointment' , 'Higher Technical Education (HTE) programme: SRO appointment'  and 'T Levels: SRO re-appointment' letters have been added.","public_timestamp":"2023-02-06T16:47:32Z"},{"note":"The Lifelong Loan Entitlement (LLE) programme, Teacher Development Reform (TDR) programme and Initial Teacher Training Reform (ITT Reform) project SRO appointment letters were added.","public_timestamp":"2022-08-17T15:59:46Z"},{"note":"Added new SRO appointment letter - School Rebuilding Programme.","public_timestamp":"2022-06-14T09:32:56Z"},{"note":"Added 'Schools commercial: SRO appointment letter'.","public_timestamp":"2022-03-28T15:57:40Z"},{"note":"Added 'Early Career Framework and National Professional Qualification programmes: SRO appointment letter'.","public_timestamp":"2021-12-06T15:03:09Z"},{"note":"Updated 'Apprenticeships: SRO appointment letter'.","public_timestamp":"2020-11-20T10:59:40Z"},{"note":"Added 'Student Loans Company, Evolve programme: SRO appointment letter'.","public_timestamp":"2020-11-04T15:49:38Z"},{"note":"Replaced 'T Levels: SRO appointment letter' with an updated version. ","public_timestamp":"2020-10-23T15:21:35Z"},{"note":"Added 'Social Work England (SWE): SRO appointment letter'.","public_timestamp":"2020-06-30T15:18:03Z"},{"note":"Added Priority School Building Programme 2: SRO appointment letter","public_timestamp":"2020-01-16T11:48:00Z"},{"note":"Added apprenticeship reform programme Senior Responsible Owner (SRO) appointment letter.","public_timestamp":"2019-08-06T14:44:20Z"},{"note":"SRO appointment letter for T Levels added. Removed SRO appointment letter for the priority school building programme phase 1 as this has now finished. Removed SRO appointment letter for the priority school building programme phase 2 for updating due to change in SRO.","public_timestamp":"2019-05-09T16:20:15Z"},{"note":"First published.","public_timestam